    "updated_at": "2021-09-03T07:24:57Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think Chrome and Safari do require a MIME type for this. See https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6468 for the corresponding HTML issue.\r\n\r\nI guess that means we should adjust Firefox and close this PR?",
